  <p>
    Major repairs and replacements - a new furnace, a full repipe, a panel upgrade - rarely arrive on a convenient schedule. We offer financing options so the size of the project doesn't have to dictate whether it gets fixed right.
  </p>

  <h2>Current financing highlights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No payments for 12 months on qualifying HVAC installations</li>
    <li>Fixed monthly payment plans for larger plumbing and electrical projects</li>
    <li>Application decisions typically same-day</li>
    <li>No prepayment penalty if you want to pay a plan off early</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>
    During your free estimate, your technician can walk you through current financing options for your specific project and connect you with an application on the spot - no separate appointment required.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions about whether your project qualifies? <a href="/contact/">Reach out to our team</a> before your appointment and we'll go over the options.
  </p>
